{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mimi the Cat - New Friends </i> is a sokoban-style game where you can push boxes, stack boxes, and even jump between platforms, so that the lovely little cat Mimi can have her well-deserved rest in her bed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454020/extras/6bb408eecbbf85c2f543e1745b2502a8.poster.avif?t=1761074494\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454020/extras/6bb408eecbbf85c2f543e1745b2502a8.webm?t=1761074494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454020/extras/6bb408eecbbf85c2f543e1745b2502a8.mp4?t=1761074494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to the environment! Throughout the game, you will have the opportunity to unlock a new adorable cat or continue to the next levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454020/extras/233e439836b13ab5723357d0b72f52f0.poster.avif?t=1761074494\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454020/extras/233e439836b13ab5723357d0b72f52f0.webm?t=1761074494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454020/extras/233e439836b13ab5723357d0b72f52f0.mp4?t=1761074494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to play with the unlocked kitten instead of Mimi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454020/extras/cdade69af251f966c9c3dc222437bad7.poster.avif?t=1761074494\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454020/extras/cdade69af251f966c9c3dc222437bad7.webm?t=1761074494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454020/extras/cdade69af251f966c9c3dc222437bad7.mp4?t=1761074494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no time limit or resources to manage, so you can calmly focus on solving the challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 50 handcrafted levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A tip on how many boxes are needed. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454020/extras/f5956285050fa382a32b10f08c492c9e.poster.avif?t=1761074494\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454020/extras/f5956285050fa382a32b10f08c492c9e.webm?t=1761074494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454020/extras/f5956285050fa382a32b10f08c492c9e.mp4?t=1761074494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Jump between platforms, like a good cat would. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454020/extras/b77a20c148662d7190bd40f4062b47a1.poster.avif?t=1761074494\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454020/extras/b77a20c148662d7190bd40f4062b47a1.webm?t=1761074494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454020/extras/b77a20c148662d7190bd40f4062b47a1.mp4?t=1761074494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlock new kittens. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stack boxes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Minimalist interface and gameplay. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Restart level. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Catchy soundtrack. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose another kitten to play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun and sweet sokoban with relaxing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mimi, Branquinho, Nevezinho, Melzinha, Cinzendo, Negan, are here to warm your heart \u2665</h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Level 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2454020/e6612d0bf8f0bcca531fec29b129363138cc0014.jpg"},{"name":"Level 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2454020/2f8db69b7e5daddb10ddbd71350f0982a2b171ae.jpg"},{"name":"Level 20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2454020/bebaed4216abbaa3d0b747e5be16ef466ffca6dc.jpg"},{"name":"Level 30","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2454020/6798ee6c7f3187162bc0ac02a80d066861ece9db.jpg"},{"name":"All level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2454020/389a49feee7be53438ed84f9cc038e10a76076cd.jpg"},{"name":"Lest Play!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2454020/09c8bcb4aa81dd5805300c5406fca1a0479c2430.jpg"},{"name":"I have a new friend :3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2454020/af02bea9451e929770999e63ed6c867c40210832.jpg"},{"name":"hey, come back here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity